1. SCOPE

These terms cover the contents of this repository: promotional text,
images, icons, and brand elements.

The source code of the rootline application is not in this repository and
is not public. The application itself is served at
rootline.cansoykanyilmaz.com.

2. USE OF THE APPLICATION

You may use rootline in your browser free of charge. No registration,
account, or licence is required. Your "learned" marks are stored only in
your own browser; nothing is kept server-side.

You may use the term explanations in your own learning, when training your
team, or in internal documentation with attribution. You do not need to
ask permission for this.

3. RESTRICTIONS

The following require prior written permission:

  - Copying the whole or a substantial part of the term content and
    republishing it elsewhere
  - Offering the content as part of your own product, glossary, or dataset
  - Bulk-scraping the content for the purpose of training an AI model
  - Using the "rootline" name, logo, or interface design in your own
    product
  - Using the images and icon set in this repository outside of it

4. THIRD-PARTY CONTENT

News summaries in rootline's "gündem" section are written originally; they
are not copied from the source, and every entry links to the original
article. Headlines and links belong to the respective publishers and fall
outside these terms.

Exchange rates are ECB daily reference rates, subject to their source's
terms.

5. NO WARRANTY

THE CONTENT AND THE APPLICATION ARE PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF
ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED.

It is worth stating plainly what this means here: rootline is a learning
